    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hunter's Hand</i> is a tactical roguelike deckbuilder set in a world unraveling at the seams. Choose from powerful classes, each with unique cards and subclasses. Face monstrous Ancients\u2014eldritch horrors that twist time, poison the land, and devour hope itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Deckbuilding</strong> \u2013 Build and evolve your deck every run with 100+ cards per class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat</strong> \u2013 Each move counts. Your choices shape every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong> \u2013 New paths, encounters, and challenges every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subclasses &amp; Relics</strong> \u2013 Unlock powerful synergies and adapt your strategy mid-run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Biomes &amp; Bosses</strong> \u2013 Face the otherworldly Ancients threatening the world in 3 unique biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Lore &amp; Worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover scattered clues to uncover the truth behind the Ancients.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hunter's Hand</i> is a tactical roguelike deckbuilder set in a world unraveling at the seams. Choose from powerful classes, each with unique cards and subclasses. Face monstrous Ancients\u2014eldritch horrors that twist time, poison the land, and devour hope itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Deckbuilding</strong> \u2013 Build and evolve your deck every run with 100+ cards per class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat</strong> \u2013 Each move counts. Your choices shape every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong> \u2013 New paths, encounters, and challenges every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subclasses &amp; Relics</strong> \u2013 Unlock powerful synergies and adapt your strategy mid-run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Biomes &amp; Bosses</strong> \u2013 Face the otherworldly Ancients threatening the world in 3 unique biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Lore &amp; Worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover scattered clues to uncover the truth behind the Ancients.</p></li></ul>",
